Z||000000||AkursedX||12-10-2000||07:57 PM||||I was just going through Ryane Motorsports website (www.ryanemotorsports.com)  and they put up a post that they sold all of the manufacturing rights to a place called Held Motorsports.  They had a link to their website, but it's not up and running yet.  <P>So anyways, hopefully this'll be another place where we can all get some high performance suspension parts for our fieros. (I want tubular control arms and coil-overs!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> )<P>I just figured I'd let all of you guys know.  I hope this wasn't posted yet.  <P>WOO HOO!!!!!  100 posts!!! Hooray for me!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by AkursedX (edited 12-10-2000).]||||reg||10
